WEBVTT

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.870
"To My Honored Father in Shizuoka,

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:15.500
It has been one month
since I arrived at Sunohara House.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.700
Plenty of time to get used to walking
to school in uniform and to my new life here."

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:25.290
"Sunohara House"

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.120
All right! I should start
my homework first thing.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.910
Better to do it while I'm still in the groove.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:26.910
I'm ba--

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.410
Akkun, welcome home!

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:40.000
"However, Tokyo still abounds
with incomprehensible things."

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:16.620
Let's go, let's go, Akkun!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.080
Show the teacher what you know, Akkun!

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.250
Fight, fight, Akkun! Yeah!

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:30.370
Excuse me! Are you trying to cheer me on,
or are you trying to interrupt me?!

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:33.750
"Special Training, Snip Snip, Fears"

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:37.790
B-Besides, why are you wearing that outfit?

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.250
Allow me to explain it to you.

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:44.500
Next week, our school shall hold a--

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.580
Ow!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.580
President!

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:47.580
Oh, dear! Oh, dear!

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.950
Are you all right?

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:54.080
Now then, Shiina.

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:54.080
She's tough.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:59.000
The first large-scale event since
you enrolled is coming up soon.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.660
What do you think it is?

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:06.450
Um, well we already had
orientation, so... a field trip?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.790
No, that can't be it.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.040
Hmm, was else was there...?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.540
No, no, no, dummy!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.410
That was a really solid punch.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:19.120
The event I mean is...

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.910
School!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.910
Field!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.120
Day!

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:23.660
...School Field Day!

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:27.160
They sure are enthusiastic...

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.950
Field Day? Oh, so that's why.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.290
Exactly.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:35.290
Every Field Day needs a cheer squad.
Every cheer squad needs cheerleaders.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:40.040
I actually made the outfit for Sumire,
but then she refused.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.910
Yamanashi- <i>senpai</i> ? In this outfit...

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.540
Wipe that fantasy from your brain right now.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.950
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:53.330
If she's cheering, then that means...

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.580
...she's coming to school...

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.790
...d-dressed like this?!

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.830
Are you interested?

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:04.540
Quit goofing around and listen!

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:05.950
R-Right!

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.290
Ahem.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:11.040
Luckily, everyone from
Sunohara House is on the same team.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:14.620
And my pride demands that we must not lose!

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.450
Accordingly, I'm having you enter
the parent-child three-legged race with Ayaka.

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:20.910
What? No one asked me about that.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:24.330
I have instructed Ayaka
to train you diligently.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.410
Starting tomorrow, you will
devote yourself to practicing.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.660
But...

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.290
Let's work hard together, Akkun!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.950
O-O-Okay!

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.910
Unnecessary amount of contact!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.750
I'm not very experienced,
but let's do our best.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.660
R-Right. Same here.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:46.910
Oh, this reminds me of my school days!

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:50.290
Okay, first let's make sure
we stretch properly.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:54.080
Here we go. Squeeeeze.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.080
Squeeze.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.790
That doesn't hurt, does it, Akkun?

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.500
N-No, not at all!

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:06.000
Could I have you do me next?

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.330
S-Sure!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.830
Akkun, you can go a little harder.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.910
L-Like this?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:28.040
That's it. You were very good.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.950
No more making weird noises!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:34.040
Okay, all set!

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:37.330
Now, it's time for the actual practice.

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:46.080
Is this position okay for you?

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.540
Don't worry about it.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:55.160
I might look a little lame,
but Miss Caretaker is so warm and smells nice.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.580
We'll start off slow. Ready?

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.160
Y-Yes!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.200
Then here we go.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:13.700
One, two. One, two.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:15.830
Akkun, you're doing so well!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:19.200
I bet we can try picking up the pace.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.040
O-Okay.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:42.250
One, two. One, two.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:36.790
Yes, just like that!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.910
Let's leave it at this for today.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:50.160
Miss Caretaker's stamina is unbelievable.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.700
Tomorrow, we'll start at 5 AM!

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.790
Wait, is she actually the athletic type?!

00:06:58.700 --> 00:06:59.790
Akkun.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.040
Wh-What is it?

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.290
Could you go get ready to take a bath?

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:08.120
Okay.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.830
I guess I did get pretty sweaty.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.450
Time to wash it off.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.370
Sorry it took so long.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.450
M-Miss Caretaker?! How come you're--

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:29.120
It looked like your hair had gotten
pretty long, so I thought I'd cut it for you.

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.370
B-But that's... I...

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:35.540
It's more economic and convenient
than going to a barber. Right?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:41.120
Have you always had this hairstyle, Akkun?

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.120
Um, yes. Since elementary school.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:46.910
I've never really thought about changing it.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.540
I-Is it weird?

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:56.080
I was just thinking about how boys your age
try to look a certain way for a girl.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.290
I-I've never done that!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:06.790
Well, um, maybe you could give me
a hairstyle you think is nice...

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.540
What?

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:14.830
I-I don't really get that kind of stuff,
so I thought you might know what's best!

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.540
I see.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:21.500
Since you're depending on me,
I'll really have to go all out!

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:28.120
Did practice tire you out?

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:29.910
Yeah, a little.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:34.830
But I still need more practice, don't I?
I couldn't really get the timing...

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:38.040
Don't worry. You have me.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.000
Miss Caretaker...

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.750
Let's do our best on Field Day, okay?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:43.910
Okay!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:49.410
Snip, snip.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.910
Did you get sleepy?

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.160
Akkun.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.410
Yes...?

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.750
How's this?

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.580
I like it!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.450
That makes my effort worth it.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:18.200
All that's left is to maybe part it differently.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.370
Oh, how cute!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:23.870
I'm actually going for cool...

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.120
Now then, I'll also shampoo you, okay?

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.660
You don't have any itchy spots, do you?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.450
I-I'm fine.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.790
This feels so nice!
Way better than when I do it.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:42.660
Akkun, Akkun!

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.040
Yes?

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.660
Cat ears!

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.120
Oh, goodness. I'm sorry.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:20.500
Sorry if it's a little cramped. Here I come.

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.950
Wh-What?!

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:26.120
Listen, Akkun. This is also part of our training.

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:28.500
F-For the three-legged race?

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:32.950
The more in sync our breathing is,
the faster we can go!

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:37.250
And to do that, we have to
get closer to each other.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.660
So you see?

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.330
Wh-What do you mean, "so you see"?!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.620
Besides, I've already been in long enoug--

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.870
Kersplash!

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:56.000
Every day until Field Day...

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.250
We're going to be that close...

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:15.660
Every day after that, our training
to get more in sync increased in intensity.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.000
Then Field Day arrived.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.950
All right. Move out!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.660
Shiina, you're ready for this, right?

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:41.580
The strain of long-term physical
and mental proximity to Ayaka

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:43.580
must have been too great.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:51.540
What a dopey face he's making.
He's going to be useless today.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.000
"Sunohara House"

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.370
Wh-What's wrong?!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:06.330
Gi... Gi...

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.450
Gi?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.250
Give me privacy, idiot!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.790
G-Giant spider. On the wall.

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.660
"Bath in Use"

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:23.870
Y-You're a guy, aren't you? Go! Get it!

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:26.080
I don't want to. And it's scary.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.290
It's escaping!

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:31.250
You're such a wimp, you coward!
Sissy! Spineless!

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:34.700
Are you afraid of spiders, President?

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:40.580
Yeah. Well, bugs in general. Especially when
they're nearly dead and twitching.

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:46.200
Ahh! There's a nearly dead bug
twitching right there!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.160
Psych! Just kidding!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.910
President!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.580
Are you all right, President?

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.080
Leave this problem to me.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.620
Focus your mind. Sense the spider.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:18.950
Above me!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:26.000
Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> ?

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.910
Huntsman spiders are beneficial.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.200
Yuri?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:38.160
Some people consider them pests,
but they don't harm humans.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:40.120
So no need to exterminate them.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:44.790
Yur--

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.950
Still, we can't just leave it here.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.660
Akkun?

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.080
Miss Caretaker?

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.250
I'd like to ask you something.

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:01.370
What a place to land!

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.250
Hello there.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.950
Wow. Is she just not scared?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.700
Akkun, are you busy?

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.450
Hm? Uh, no.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:21.750
Oh, good! Then you can
go out with me while I shop.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.290
G-Go out with you?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:25.500
Not like that.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:30.370
It's the first time I've gone
somewhere with Miss Caretaker.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:34.700
Hmm, what should I wear?

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:35.950
How about this?

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:40.040
I see! With this I'll have a fighting cha--

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.910
Wait, no, I won't!

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.450
It looks good on you.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:46.040
It's just shopping. Don't get so worked up.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.250
You're such a child.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.500
Oh, no! A spider!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:53.290
No, there isn't! Idiot!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.080
Yuzu really hates spiders, doesn't she?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.250
Everyone's afraid of somethin--

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:03.790
Actually, I couldn't tell you
what Ayaka's afraid of.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:07.250
Yeah, she was totally fine with that spider.

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:12.000
Listen up, Shiina. While you're out
with Ayaka, find out what scares her.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.290
We'll finish dinner
preparations while we wait.

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:18.000
You can cook, President?!

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:21.120
No one peels a potato better than I do!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.160
Thank you, Akkun.

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:30.370
I'm happy to help if I can.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:34.950
We'll have kind of a lot of bags,
so I thought I'd ask for your help.

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.290
I'd be happy to carry things any time.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.410
Could it be that right now...

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:52.790
...we look like a couple?!

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:58.330
Mother and daughter? No, maybe sisters.

00:15:58.330 --> 00:15:59.870
How heart-warming.

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:08.160
"Yatsuho Liquor"

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:04.700
Good afternoon, Ms. Yatsuho.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:08.700
Hey, Ayaka! Oh, and the one
from the other day.

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:12.410
Oh, Akkun, you already know Ms. Yatsuho?

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:15.160
She gave me directions once.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:19.040
Akkun? You're a boy?!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.700
Yes, I'm a guy.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.410
How can I help you today, Ayaka?

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.750
Mirin and cooking alcohol, please.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.950
Got it. So the usual.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:33.950
Oh, and I'm glad to have your help
during Beerfest again this year.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:37.120
Happy to help. I'll be in good hands.

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.080
Beerfest?

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:44.290
It's a beer festival. Ayaka's
actually a pretty tough drinker.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.950
She's a handful once she's drunk, though.

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:51.540
Oh, you're exaggerating!

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:51.540
So Miss Caretaker drinks alcohol.

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:17.080
I suppose I still don't really know
much about Miss Caretaker.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.910
Not even what she likes, let alone her fears...

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.620
Akkun.

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:41.290
You were a big help today!
I'll have to find a way to thank you.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.370
Thank me? I didn't do much.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.450
Hmm, what should it be?

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:54.160
What's happening now is more than enough.

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.750
We're back!

00:17:58.830 --> 00:17:59.910
Welcome ho--

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.330
Hands, hands!

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:07.200
You'll corrupt public morals!
I already told you about unnecessary contact!

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.620
True.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.620
Let go on the count of three!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.250
It's so peaceful.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.250
One, two...

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:18.000
So, did you find out what Ayaka's afraid of?

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.330
No, not a thing.

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:23.250
Oh, well. We'll move on to our special plan.

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:27.580
See how Ayaka reacts to this horror film.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:32.000
What is this thing?

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.870
Yes?

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:43.040
U-Um, Miss Caretaker, would you like
to watch a movie with me?

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:46.040
A movie? Sure!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.500
U-Um, why did you turn off the lights?

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.580
I thought it would set the atmosphere.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:14.040
There, there.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:16.290
How can the plan work if you get scared?

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:19.080
Oh, well. Next plan. Yuri!

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:21.000
Here you go!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.950
A coat? What's scary about this?

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:28.250
You're going to wear that with no clothes
and open it in front of her!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.450
That would just make me a deviant!

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:32.580
Okay, next. Sumire.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.290
Something scary?

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:43.160
It would be scary to be
parted from you, President.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.540
My chest tightens just thinking about it.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:49.370
That's only scary to you!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:55.580
Oh, well. You'll just have to ask
Ayaka directly what scares her.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:20:00.910
Um, President, I don't want
to keep doing tests on her.

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:03.910
Don't you want to know her weakness?

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:06.120
Her weakness?

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.500
"Something Scary"

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.370
What a man. I love you!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:13.750
Here I go!

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:16.830
Easy mark.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.200
Miss Caretaker!

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:22.950
What's the matter, Akkun?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.790
I-I'll ask you upfront: what scares you?

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.290
What scares me?

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:35.290
So that's why you wanted to watch
a horror movie all of a sudden.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.450
Let me think...

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:47.450
If someone I don't know came
into my room when I'm asleep...

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.290
...that would be scary.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:51.080
I-It certainly would.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:54.830
Well, good night.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.200
Sh-She is asleep, right?

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:20.080
I-I should just leave.

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:29.830
Akkun, I was putting on a brave face
because you got so scared.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:33.410
But the truth is, horror movies scare me.

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:39.450
I can't fall asleep by myself. You better
take responsibility and sleep with me.

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:52.290
My, my!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.750
Sh-Shiina!

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:41.950
"Elders, Getting Changed, Being a Man"
